# Public surface allowlist for h3lp.
# A file ships because it is named here, never because it sits in the repo.
# README.md and LICENSE are deliberately absent: build-public.sh replaces them
# with a stub so a probe gets a harmless answer instead of repository content.

index.html
_headers
404.html
manifest.webmanifest
site.css
site.js
sw.js
assets
